    "font" : "SFTI1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Lemma 3.7. The natural map fn± : H±1 (Kn,p,E[p∞]) −→ H±1 (K∞,w,E[p∞])[ωn±] is injective, and the cokernel of fn± is a ﬁnite group for any positive integer n. Here, we deﬁne H±1 (K∞,w,E[p∞]) := lim"
