    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. Note that we have E[p∞]GK∞,p = 0 by [15, Proposition 3.2]. By Inﬂation-Restriction exact sequence, we see that the canonical map"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
