    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "and H±1 (K∞,w,E[p∞])[ωn±] are same. Since we have H±1 (K∞,w,E[p∞])∨ ≃ Λ2 as Λ-module by the Rubin conjecture, we see that"
